From: Senior Matthew <SeniorMatt@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 08:21:23 +0500
Subject: [PATCH 05/35] System Settings: accordion sidebar, page cache, search
 with breadcrumbs

The sidebar is one column. SidebarModel flattens group headers, categories
and the pages of the open category into rows. Clicking a category opens
its first page and shows its pages, one category at a time. Keys: Up/Down,
Right/Enter expand, Left collapses (mirrored for RTL).

SidebarMode::loadModule keeps the last pages alive (6 by default,
SYSTEMSETTINGS_PAGE_CACHE overrides, 0 is the old behaviour) after asking
about unsaved changes as before. Search results show their category as a
subtitle. Info Center keeps its two-column sidebar.

